1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,199
Blemishes, blackheads, dull or uneven skin?

2
00:00:03,199 --> 00:00:06,048
Then this exfoliant is worth a closer look.

3
00:00:06,048 --> 00:00:08,897
This is the Dermalogica Daily Microfoliant.

4
00:00:08,897 --> 00:00:14,462
In this video we'll cover what it is, what's inside, who it's for, and how to use it

5
00:00:14,462 --> 00:00:15,324
step by step.

6
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:17,365
First, what it is.

7
00:00:17,365 --> 00:00:23,176
Daily Microfoliant is an exfoliating powder made from rice, and it's rich in alpha

8
00:00:23,176 --> 00:00:24,168
hydroxy acids.

9
00:00:24,939 --> 00:00:27,022
It stays a dry powder in the jar.

10
00:00:27,022 --> 00:00:29,547
The moment it meets water, it activates.

11
00:00:30,247 --> 00:00:35,507
When it activates, it releases papain, salicylic acid and rice bran, which polish

12
00:00:35,507 --> 00:00:36,091
the skin.

13
00:00:36,856 --> 00:00:41,370
Together they remove the dulling debris that sits on the surface of your skin, and

14
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:42,966
they help even out skin tone.

15
00:00:43,721 --> 00:00:46,117
Next is the Skin Brightening Complex.

16
00:00:46,117 --> 00:00:51,297
It combines phytic acid from rice bran with white tea and licorice, and it helps

17
00:00:51,297 --> 00:00:52,915
balance uneven skin tone.

18
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:58,139
For comfort, there's colloidal oatmeal and allantoin, which help calm the skin.

19
00:00:58,839 --> 00:01:03,282
That calming side is why it's gentle enough to use every day, which is where the

20
00:01:03,282 --> 00:01:05,226
name Daily Microfoliant comes from.

21
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:07,065
So who is it for?

22
00:01:07,065 --> 00:01:12,289
It's recommended for all skin types, and it's listed for blemishes and blackheads,

23
00:01:12,289 --> 00:01:15,219
dullness, uneven texture and uneven skin tone.

24
00:01:15,983 --> 00:01:17,069
Now, how to use it.

25
00:01:17,069 --> 00:01:20,612
Shake about half a teaspoon of the powder into very wet hands.

26
00:01:21,312 --> 00:01:25,875
Rub your hands together until it turns creamy, then apply it to your face in

27
00:01:25,875 --> 00:01:26,895
circular motions.

28
00:01:26,895 --> 00:01:28,036
Avoid the eye area.

29
00:01:28,796 --> 00:01:32,017
Massage gently for about one minute, then rinse thoroughly.

30
00:01:32,717 --> 00:01:37,197
If you notice any irritation, use it less often until your skin is comfortable.

31
00:01:37,897 --> 00:01:43,064
It comes in thirteen gram, forty gram and seventy-four gram sizes, and there's a

32
00:01:43,064 --> 00:01:44,937
seventy-four gram refill too.

33
00:01:44,937 --> 00:01:50,298
So, to recap: a rice-based powder that activates with water, with papain, salicylic

34
00:01:50,298 --> 00:01:55,724
acid and rice bran to polish, a brightening complex for uneven tone, and oatmeal and

35
00:01:55,724 --> 00:01:58,759
allantoin to keep it calm enough for daily use.

36
00:01:58,759 --> 00:02:01,472
That's the Dermalogica Daily Microfoliant.

37
00:02:01,472 --> 00:02:03,474
The link is in the description.
